to-be-incorporated-into-paper-127 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-127 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: **Multiplicities.** A Π binder or a constructor field may carry a multiplicity: `(x :0 A) → B`" (cons "(erased: `x` is used only in positions the back end erases, which is every type), `(x :1 A) → B`" (cons "(linear: consumed exactly once), and `(x : A) → B` (no constraint). The checker computes every" (cons "binder's usage (0, 1 or ω) after a definition checks, with the rules of the earlier plan (PLAN.md revision 7.9, 6 Nov 2026, git 2ca8d747aaa5:PLAN.md, §18.1 “B11 — Multiplicities (static side)”) — an argument" (cons "counts as many times as the function's binder says, a type counts nothing, a line of types a" (cons "transport runs along and a Glue system count ω — and reports a binder annotated `:0` that is used" (cons "or `:1` that is dropped or duplicated. A data type with a field at `:1` is linear: its values are" (cons "linear wherever they are bound, and its constructors are applied only in a `primitive`. `#usage f`" (cons "prints a checked definition's binder usages (the back end erases the binders at 0, annotated or" (cons "not)." nil))))))))))
